{"tool_name":"blight","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"blight","home":"http://github.com/Malfoy/BLight","license":"AGPL-3.0","summary":"Blight is an associative data structure, similar to a hashtable, able to index a kmer set. It associates each kmer with a unique identifier and can identify alien kmers (kmer absent from the index) associated with the identifier -1. The kmer identifiers are in[0, N[ where N is the number of kmer in the index. Hence, one can see Blight as a Minimal Perfect Hash Function (MPHF) that handle alien kmers.","addition_date":"2021-06-14T13:02:18Z","last_update_date":"2021-08-18T08:37:14Z","tool_type":["Library"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:blight","credit":[{"email":"antoine.limasset@univ-lille.fr","name":"Antoine Limasset","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0669-4141","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"email":"camille.marchet@univ-lille.fr","name":"Camille Marchet","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7235-7346","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"De-novo assembly","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0524"},{"term":"Query and retrieval","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0224"},{"term":"k-mer counting","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3472"}]}],"name":"BLight","owner":"Kigaard","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/BIOINFORMATICS/BTAB217","pmid":"33821954"}],"topic":[{"term":"Metagenomics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174"},{"term":"Sequencing","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3168"},{"term":"Transcriptomics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3308"}]},"bioschemas":{"name":"BLight","home":"https://bio.tools/blight","license":"AGPL-3.0","summary":"Blight is an associative data structure, similar to a hashtable, able to index a kmer set. It associates each kmer with a unique identifier and can identify alien kmers (kmer absent from the index) associated